OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Funsettled this evening with a band of
OL,7,Fmore persistent rain arriving into the
OL,8,Fsouthwest and pushing across the
OL,9,Fregion into the night. Showers
OL,10,Ffollowing on behind. Windy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA generally cloudy day with
OL,13,Fshowery outbreaks throughout and a
OL,14,Frisk of thunder at times associated
OL,15,Fwith heavier showers. Remaining windy
OL,16,Falong the south coast and cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
